"""
Populate TerraMind AI agriculture KB documents with REAL authoritative
source-backed crop production / agricultural-overview content.

Source URLs are real, public, and on hosts inside the configured trusted tiers
(.edu cooperative extension, FAO, USDA ERS national agencies). Every URL in
this module is checked by scripts/verify_agriculture_sources.py before the
documents are written.

Scope per document (per the placeholder instructions): agro-ecological zones
suited to the crop, typical yield ranges, rotation partners, cover-cropping
integration, economic importance, major production regions and climate
adaptation.

RULES FOLLOWED (identical to the disease / treatment / fertilizer / plant_care
KB phases):
- PRESERVE existing document_id, crop, class_label, filename and schema.
- Set metadata.status = 'sourced', placeholder_replaced = 'true',
  last_reviewed = 2026-09-22.
- Do NOT touch ML / training / RAG / backend files.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

from dataclasses import dataclass


